Hi Managers,

 My question was about the difference between LSM and AdvFS filesystem
since they seems to offer some quite similar functionalities. 
Well, they are independent things and AdvFS may work fine (and with its
functionality to online expansion filesystem and others) without LSM
support. LSM comes when you want to do things like mirroring of disks. 
LSM work with disk and give volumes that can be used by AdvFS to create
domains and therefore mountable filesets.
 I was told also that the documention about LSM is very large and you 
need to read tedious document in order to get this working. 

