My previous summary to the above was not quite complete. The possible values
and meanings for the console variable auto_action are:

HALT - the system does not auto boot at power on, or after a crash
BOOT - the system auto boots at power on, but not after a crash
RESTART - the system auto boots at power on and after a crash

