Original post reflected that uerf errored on a DS20....was attempting to show 
the SRM version.

Thanks to quick responses from:
Ian Mortimer	Mandell.Degerness	Dr. Tom Blinn	Teron Jones
Alan Davis		Stephen Spalding		Roberto Romani	Grant Van Dyck
and Alan@nabeth

UERF is incompatable with the EV6 error log format.  To reveal the SRM 
version you can:
1) DecEvent, dia 
2) Compaq Analyze
3) the  console firmware command    /sbin/consvar -v -l
4) look at  the /var/adm/messages file

or look at the SRM level  >>> sho config

