Hi all,

I have had a major problem with a Digital UNIX v4.0e panic, when building
Sybase server at the master device build stage on a raw device.
The panic string is: u_anon_free: page busy

This only APPEARS to happen on an upgraded system, not a fresh v4.0e build.
The problem was resolved by changing new-wire-method to 1 in
/etc/sysconfigtab.

Thanks to John McNulty in Compaq support at Reading for spotting this on a
notes conference, because it has bugged me for ages.. the ironic thing is
that we would have fixed it inadvertently on the next recommended changes
from sys-check.
I guess he can close the IPMT, engineering escalation now!

So if anyone is seeing the same problem, change your new wire method to 1.

cheers

